  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Associated skill 7 ranks, Performance sphere.</p>\n<p>If you have the (lyric) package, the range of your lyrics increases to medium.</p>\n<p>If you have the (act), (dance), or (instrumental) package, the area of your acts, dances, or instrumentals increase to a close-range radius.</p>\n<p>You may select this talent a second time when you possess 15 ranks in an associated skill. If you do, the area or range of the associated Performance sphere ability increases by one step (close to medium, medium to long).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/performance#toc58\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
